{"id":"36ea13b2c907298798e7e943505f5d0285cb9900","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233436","title":"Claude 模型现在将在所有文本中嵌入不可见的数字水印，这对国内使用会带来什么负面影响吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"androidCoder","excerpt":"Claude - @androidCoder -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/水印\"><li></li> 水印</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/影响\"><li></li> 影响</a></P><p><span>28 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-11 22:01:54 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959684\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9804/9118/39005_normal.png?m=1782023903\" alt=\"Admstor\" data-uid=\"39005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Admstor\">Admstor</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:59:33 +08:00\">12h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>再用国内 AI 把水印去掉呗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959696\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cbdc2d2abea269348d232f9f265e7072?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuewolf\" data-uid=\"75037\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuewolf\">yuewolf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:00:26 +08:00\">12h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>见识浅薄，不知道文本中怎么嵌入数字水印</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/47e1/761c/530166_normal.png?m=1711442407\" alt=\"cwcc\" data-uid=\"530166\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cwcc\">cwcc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:03:04 +08:00\">12h 24m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>用 SaaS 就要接受 SaaS 模式的局限性，就算再好再便宜也会迟早都有这种问题。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959747\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:07:09 +08:00\">12h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只能说 A/还是魔，如果是插入那些肉眼不可见的字符，想去除太简单了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960031\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/17d3/d5c9/71891_normal.png?m=1752241801\" alt=\"106npo\" data-uid=\"71891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/106npo\">106npo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:32:11 +08:00\">11h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其实是可以按位置微调 token 出现的概率.你看内容没啥差别,但原厂分析概率分布就能发现是不是他们生成的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960066\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/598f/e08b/540117_normal.png?m=1775783079\" alt=\"Sundayz\" data-uid=\"540117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sundayz\">Sundayz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:34:47 +08:00\">11h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有影响，因为我们都用 Codex</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960925\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c00d2c0ec08778dd6b40fd3392a366a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yanqiyu\" data-uid=\"127736\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yanqiyu\">yanqiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 12:58:07 +08:00\">9h 28m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/maichael\">maichael</a> 不是，是在采样阶段微调 token 概率（比如偏置概率，引入特殊长程关联等）。<br>这些微调不改变语义，但是对于长文本而言，人类或者其他模型恰好写出/输出这样的 token 序列概率很小，于是就是特异性的水印了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960947\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c00d2c0ec08778dd6b40fd3392a366a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yanqiyu\" data-uid=\"127736\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yanqiyu\">yanqiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 13:08:04 +08:00\">9h 19m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>比如，采样器可以根据前 10 个 token 拿出来 hash ，给一个伪随机数发生器，然后这个随机数发生器的输出用来做 Gumbell 噪声，然后采样的文本序列去和同样的 hash 算法+伪随机数发生器+噪声算法做互相关，那么 AI 生成的文本位置就会有一个显著的关联。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17961538\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 14:47:39 +08:00\">7h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>A 社真的戏太多了，还好我用 codex</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17962096\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/82fcbc4c716cc289d59eed05b7f98336?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"scegg\" data-uid=\"128796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/scegg\">scegg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 16:15:20 +08:00\">6h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让那些做掺水的中转站们被探测出来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17962242\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e0c78417de59a55487a950a571990acd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"SiWXie\" data-uid=\"631751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SiWXie\">SiWXie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 16:33:34 +08:00\">5h 53m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要作用是防止其他公司对它们模型蒸馏，蒸馏后的模型输出也可能会带水印</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17963035\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c00d2c0ec08778dd6b40fd3392a366a3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yanqiyu\" data-uid=\"127736\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yanqiyu\">yanqiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 19:12:10 +08:00\">3h 14m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Kirkcong\">Kirkcong</a> 没有水印能抵挡完整的重写，类似于你用铅笔描一遍肯定图片水印就没了。但是要是部分重写期间，一些表述还是留下来就可能能被识别，但是置信度肯定会下降。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17963335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d1f2/b9b4/64727_normal.png?m=1786332779\" alt=\"isbase\" data-uid=\"64727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/isbase\">isbase</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 21:18:58 +08:00\">1h 8m ago via iPad</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这家公司干这种事情真他妈积极。欧盟有要求，也没见其他的 AI 厂商发话呀，他倒是积极得不得了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"水印 模型 影响28 replies • 2026-08-11 22:01:54 +08:00 1 Admstor 12h 27m ago 再用国内 AI 把水印去掉呗 2 yuewolf 12h 26m ago 见识浅薄，不知道文本中怎么嵌入数字水印 3 cwcc 12h 24m ago 1 用 SaaS 就要接受 SaaS 模式的局限性，就算再好再便宜也会迟早都有这种问题。 4 ebushicao 12h 19m ago 只能说 A/还是魔，如果是插入那些肉眼不可见的字符，想去除太简单了。 6 106npo 11h 54m ago 其实是可以按位置微调 token 出现的概率.你看内容没啥差别,但原厂分析概率分布就能发现是不是他们生成的 8 Sundayz 11h 52m ago 没有影响，因为我们都用 Codex 13 yanqiyu 9h 28m ago via Android 3 @maichael 不是，是在采样阶段微调 token 概率（比如偏置概率，引入特殊长程关联等）。这些微调不改变语义，但是对于长文本而言，人类或者其他模型恰好写出/输出这样的 token 序列概率很小，于是就是特异性的水印了。 14 yanqiyu 9h 19m ago via Android 1 比如，采样器可以根据前 10 个 token 拿出来 hash ，给一个伪随机数发生器，然后这个随机数发生器的输出用来做 Gumbell 噪声，然后采样的文本序列去和同样的 hash 算法+伪随机数发生器+噪声算法做互相关，那么 AI 生成的文本位置就会有一个显著的关联。 15 prosgtsr 7h 39m ago A 社真的戏太多了，还好我用 codex 23 scegg 6h 11m ago 让那些做掺水的中转站们被探测出来。 24 SiWXie 5h 53m ago via iPhone 主要作用是防止其他公司对它们模型蒸馏，蒸馏后的模型输出也可能会带水印 25 yanqiyu 3h 14m ago via Android @Kirkcong 没有水印能抵挡完整的重写，类似于你用铅笔描一遍肯定图片水印就没了。但是要是部分重写期间，一些表述还是留下来就可能能被识别，但是置信度肯定会下降。 26 isbase PRO 1h 8m ago via iPad 这家公司干这种事情真他妈积极。欧盟有要求，也没见其他的 AI 厂商发话呀，他倒是积极得不得了","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T14:29:28.555Z","ok":true}